000200 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000300 PROGRAM-ID.     TPLIST.
      *C
      *C 09/10/96  JEFF BUNGO
      *C   EXPAND DATE FIELDS FOR YEAR 2000 COMPLIANCE.
      *C   INCLUDE CENTURY ON SORT BY CSD DATE.
      *C
000900 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001000 CONFIGURATION SECTION.
001100 SOURCE-COMPUTER.    AS400.
001200 OBJECT-COMPUTER.    AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.      I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA
                           LOCAL-DATA IS LOCAL-DATA-AREA.
001300 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001400 FILE-CONTROL.
001500     SELECT DISK-TEMP
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-TEMPPERS
               ORGANIZATION IS RELATIVE
001600         ACCESS MODE IS RANDOM
001700         RELATIVE KEY IS AKEY
               FILE STATUS IS DT-STATUS.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
               ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZPERSON-SI
               ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
               ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS DSPLY-STATUS
               CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT PERSONNEL-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLMM0301
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS PF-STATUS.
001800     SELECT SORT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DISK-SORTFILE.
002100 DATA DIVISION.
